{"id":"marge","lemma":"marge","pos":"noun","rank":2537,"glosses":["margin (of paper, etc)","markup (percentage or amount added to buy-in price)"],"ipa":"/maʁʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/Fr-marge.ogg/Fr-marge.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"marges"},"formAudio":{"marges":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-marges.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il vit en marge de la société.","en":"He lives off the grid.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null,{"g":"society"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Nous avons une grande marge de progression.","en":"We have a lot of room for improvement.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"progression"}]},{"text":"Il reste des marges de progression.","en":"There's still room for improvement.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"rest, remainder"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"progression"}]},{"text":"La marge bénéficiaire de cette entreprise est très importante.","en":"This company's profit margin is very big.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"beneficial"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"company, business"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"important","l":"important"}]},{"text":"Y a-t-il de la marge de manœuvre ?","en":"Is there any wiggle room?","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"he / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"move, movement"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]}]}